  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.frame.year": "Relatives from your first home gather round, in person or by message, and old ties feel strong again. You find yourself at the centre of it.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.harm.day": "A small thing at home is misread, a look or a tone a partner takes differently from how you meant it. You catch the moment and put it right before bed.",
