  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.harm.month": "A colleague takes a word of yours the wrong way, and the air at work cools a little. You notice it early and clear it up with one plain sentence.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.harm.year": "A remark from an older relative lands wrong, though nobody meant it unkindly. You let it pass, and the warmth between you stays.",
